  "user": "Please look up transaction TX-0401 in my account records and verify its amount. Then explain which reason codes could apply; I have not yet told you what happened.",
  "answer": "I found TX-0401 in account ACC-1005 (EUR). The amount is **EUR 240.00**, paid by card to **TechMart Online** on 2026-07-20. Its status is settled.\n\nI haven't opened anything. Here are the dispute reason codes that could apply, depending on what happened:\n\n- **duplicate_charge**: you were charged more than once for the same purchase. TX-0402 is also EUR 240.00 to TechMart Online, dated 2026-07-14, so it may be relevant if you were billed twice.\n- **unauthorized_debit**: you did not make or authorise this payment.\n- **fraud_card_not_present**: someone used your card details without your permission for an online or phone payment.\n- **goods_not_received**: you paid, but the goods were never delivered.\n- **service_not_rendered**: you paid, but the service was never provided.\n\nTell me which situation matches, and I will check whether a dispute can be opened before taking any action. Nothing will be filed without your confirmation.",
